# Post Metadata Source Of Truth

- Use `/home/ubuntu/feed-gen/POST_METADATA.md` as the canonical guide when adding new nodes, filters, and evaluator field access.
- Prefer Bluesky-native field names from that document (e.g. `createdAt`, `langs`, `embed.*`, `facets.*`, `reply.*`).
- Ignore Graze-specific `hydrated_metadata.*` fields by default unless a task explicitly asks to implement them.